---
const painPoints = [
  {
    title: "Support becomes firefighting",
    description:
      "Your team spends more time solving the same recurring problems than helping franchisees grow."
  },
  {
    title: "Execution varies by location",
    description:
      "Brand standards are interpreted differently, creating an inconsistent customer experience and unpredictable results."
  },
  {
    title: "Franchisees resist the system",
    description:
      "Owners push against proven processes, question expectations, or try to rebuild the model around their preferences."
  },
  {
    title: "Communication creates friction",
    description:
      "Coaching feels like conflict, feedback gets lost, and small misunderstandings begin to erode trust."
  },
  {
    title: "Effort does not equal performance",
    description:
      "Capable, hardworking owners still struggle because their skills, motivations, or working style do not fit the model."
  },
  {
    title: "Growth gets harder to sustain",
    description:
      "Underperformance affects validation, referrals, retention, and the confidence to keep awarding new locations."
  }
];
---

<section class="bg-[#f3f3f3] py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="overflow-hidden bg-white lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.86fr)_minmax(0,1.14fr)]">
      <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#f3f3f3] px-7 py-10  md:px-12 md:py-14 lg:min-h-[680px] lg:px-14 lg:py-16">
        <div>
          <p class="section-eyebrow">When Alignment Is Off</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Misalignment rarely announces itself.</h2>
          <p class="section-copy max-w-3xl">
            What looks like a training problem, a difficult franchisee, or an isolated performance issue is often a deeper mismatch between the owner and the system.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="px-7 py-4 md:px-12 lg:px-14 lg:py-8">
        {painPoints.map((painPoint, index) => (
          <article class="grid gap-4 border-b border-[#d9dce2] py-7 last:border-b-0 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-8">
            <span class="font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#fd7730]">
              {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl leading-tight text-[#22252a] md:text-[1.7rem]">
                {painPoint.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-[#656a73] md:text-base">
                {painPoint.description}
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/pricing">Get Started Now!</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
